The bicycle light housings that carry the handlebar interface: the first- and
second-generation front light, the rear light, the 18650 battery box and the
handlebar switch holder, plus the upstream LICENSE. Copied verbatim from the
pinned commit. The Arduino firmware, the acrylic lens script and the remaining
weight-optimisation box variants are not vendored.

